error[E0277]: `std::string::String` cannot be flattened with `#[schema(open)]`
 --> tests/ui/traits/open_map.rs:7:19
  |
7 |     is_open_map::<String>();
  |                   ^^^^^^ not a map described in place
  |
  = help: the trait `OpenMap` is not implemented for `std::string::String`
  = note: `#[schema(open)]` moves a map's value schema onto the object carrying it, which needs the map's own schema rather than a `$ref` to one
  = note: flatten the `HashMap` or `BTreeMap` field itself, or drop `#[schema(open)]` from a type that names its members
  = help: the following other types implement trait `OpenMap`:
            Arc<T>
            BTreeMap<K, V>
            Box<T>
            HashMap<K, V, S>
            Unchecked<T>
            Unchecked<serde_json::map::Map<std::string::String, serde_json::value::Value>>
